<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB Australia wheat indicator prices-March 25.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB Australia wheat indicator prices-March 25.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Wheat Board</p>
<p>international card prices for wheat exports for March 25.</p>
<p>In U.S. dollars per tonne, FOB eastern states.</p>
<p>		ASW	  AH     PH 13 PCT  PH 14 PCT</p>
<p>    Mar    203.00    207.50    208.50     221.50</p>
<p>    Apr    201.00    205.50    206.50     221.50</p>
